{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo: Make it to your first shop and customers. In the full game: Build, expand, hack rivals, and take over the entire mall with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Start from the bottom. Rise to the top. Alone or with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Mall Control</i>, you begin broke in a shady hideout, staring at the glowing lights of a shopping mall that could one day be yours. Work your way up by buying your first shop, stocking it with just enough products to attract curious customers\u2026 and maybe bending a few rules along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Build your empire by day\u00a0<br>\ud83d\udcbb Hack your way to power by night.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83e\udde9 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfae Build your mall empire </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfea <strong>Own Shops</strong>: Purchase, manage, and customize stores to increase revenue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861620/extras/094965bda89ffe2302b9c4959cbd4102.poster.avif?t=1752656402\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861620/extras/094965bda89ffe2302b9c4959cbd4102.webm?t=1752656402\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861620/extras/094965bda89ffe2302b9c4959cbd4102.mp4?t=1752656402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce6 <strong>Stock Smart</strong>: Strategically stock your products to meet demand and beat competitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Night Ops</strong>: Sneak into rival shops to steal data and sabotage\u00a0 but watch out for bodyguards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb8 <strong>Grow from Rags to Retail Ruler</strong>: Every decision affects your rise\u00a0 will you play it clean or dirty?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're charming customers or dodging security in the dark, <i>Mall Control</i> is a unique blend of <strong>simulation, strategy, and stealth</strong> with a dash of dark humor.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Find Money !","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861620/cd6fa8cbfac32c9386788fc75ac14ea18d35a256.jpg"},{"name":"Bank Transfer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861620/f417603ad44dd123efa18f169374e219a21f4e9c.jpg"},{"name":"Buy Store","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3861620/7490187a543275fbfc2e533f52e22e59e86e999a.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3861620?t=1752656402","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861620/ce206aeae084f6c7132a7051e5e75b71b7fd2770/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752656402","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861620/4908868b0a97ca22a2bf936b46e4ad7cacc6638e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752656402","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3861620/4908868b0a97ca22a2bf936b46e4ad7cacc6638e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752656402","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In 